NowCoding is inspired by vibe-usage (https://github.com/peeerdat/vibe-usage).

The 18 parser strategies, 30-minute bucket aggregation logic, and the
ingest protocol shape are derived in spirit from that project. NowCoding
adds public-facing identity (profile + SVG badges + README cards) and
single-tenant Vercel-native deployment.

If you maintain a parser-aware tool that NowCoding helps observe, see
docs/parsers.md for the supported list.
